e/Diplomatic_Impunity\" title=\"Diplomatic Impunity\">Diplomatic Impunity</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Surge\" title=\"Elemental Surge\">Elemental Surge</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Surge\" title=\"Elemental Surge\">Elemental Surge</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 12<br /><b>Charges: </b>10 (10/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 10 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:10)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +36</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +36</a>:</b> Passive: +36 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Wand_of_Blasting.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Wand_of_Blasting.png/420px-Wand_of_Blasting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"467\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Wand_of_Blasting.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>Many strange and powerful magical artifacts have been unearthed from the ancient Droaam ruins. This one is a wand that unpredictably casts one of many destructive spells when activated.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Suspected damage:\n<ul><li>10d6 fire, cold, acid, or electric damage (unconfirmed).</li>\n<li>Deals ~70-75 damage with Wand Mastery I (+25%). Perhaps 12x(1d3+3) = average 60</li>\n<li>55-65 damage with no wand damage enhancements. 12x(1d3+3) looks about right (and is consistent with its caster level of 12)</li>\n<li>Does not appear to have a saving throw</li>\n<li>Charges take more time to regenerate than they do for other eternal wands.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817232459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3049/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21540/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6165/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.693      1 -total\n 67.81%   54.040      1 Template:Named_item\n 63.71%   50.776      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 32.11%   25.592      1 Template:Non-food\n 31.44%   25.054      4 Template:Popup\n 30.03%   23.933      1 Template:Mat\n 26.60%   21.201      1 Template:Red\n 23.14%   18.440      1 Template:Color\n 17.97%   14.324      2 Template:IsColorCode\n 15.32%   12.208      2 Template:Isnum\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12325-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817232459 and revision id 635752. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Non-food|WAI=true}}\n{{Named item|Eternal wand\n  | name                     = Wand of Blasting\n  | umd                      = 35\n  | noumd                    = Wiz, Sor\n  | minlevel                 = 10\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA|1}}\n  | durability               = 25\n  | material                 = Wood\n  | hardness                 = 10\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | cost                     = 22,400 pp\n  | quest                    = Diplomatic Impunity\n  | chest                    = end chest\n  | released                 = Update 7\n  | description              = \nMany strange and powerful magical artifacts have been unearthed from the ancient Droaam ruins. This one is a wand that unpredictably casts one of many destructive spells when activated.\n  | notes                    = Suspected damage:\n* 10d6 fire, cold, acid, or electric damage (unconfirmed).\n* Deals ~70-75 damage with Wand Mastery I (+25%). Perhaps 12x(1d3+3) = average 60\n* 55-65 damage with no wand damage enhancements. 12x(1d3+3) looks about right (and is consistent with its caster level of 12)\n* Does not appear to have a saving throw\n* Charges take more time to regenerate than they do for other eternal wands.\n  | icon                     = Fireball.png\n  | spell                    = Elemental Surge\n  | casterlvl                = 12\n  | charge                   = 10\n  | crafting                 = \n  | craftingupgrade          = \n  | picdesc                  = Wand of Blasting.png\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Clicky|Elemental Surge|12|10|10}}\n* {{SpellPower|Potency|36}}\n}}",
